AWS Cloud Transformation Case Study
Intelligent Automation in Fraud Operations
Scaling compliance and streamlining low-value dispute processing through Amazon Web Services Intelligent Document Processing (IDP) and Generative AI.

Training Blocker: Fraud analysts manually read massive compliance documents just to tick an acceptance checkbox, draining active dispute resolution hours.
Sub-£25 Botttleneck: Manual receipt audits are mandatory before "auto-approving" low-value disputes (<£25), delaying resolution times.

GenAI Training (Bedrock): Ingests policy PDFs to generate concise 1-page summaries and micro-quizzes, ensuring actual audit-ready comprehension.
AI receipt Parsing (Textract): Auto-extracts merchant, amount, and date from receipt uploads without pre-defined templates.
Auto-Workflow (Step Functions): Cross-checks metadata to instantly approve clear claims or route anomalies to human teams.


Straight-Through Processing: Converts low-value disputes into instant, second-long automated completions.
Active Auditing: Replaces simple checkboxes with comprehension tracking (saved on AWS DynamoDB).
Optimized Human Focus: Shifts highly trained analysts from checking receipts to hunting complex fraud rings.
